</header>
<div class="cat-bar"><div class="cat-bar-inner"><a href="/virtual-credit-card/">虚拟卡评测</a><a href="/cross-border-collections/">跨境支付收款</a><a href="/cryptocurrency/">加密货币</a></div></div>
<div class="layout">
  <main><section class="home-hero"><h1>虚拟信用卡评测与推荐 — 60+ 平台实测</h1><p>跨境支付虚拟信用卡实测评测：费率、KYC、开卡与充值方式、风控与真实使用体验。</p></section><article class="post-card">
      <a class="post-thumb" href="/2025/12/15/roogoo-virtual-card/"><img src="/media/1304-roogoo3-scaled.jpg" alt="Roogoo虚拟卡深度评测：零费率多场景覆盖/跨境支付自由神器" width="2560" height="1453" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"></a>
      <div class="post-body">
        <div class="post-meta"><span class="cat">评测</span><span>2025-12-15</span></div>
        <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/2025/12/15/roogoo-virtual-card/">Roogoo虚拟卡深度评测：零费率多场景覆盖/跨境支付自由神器</a></h2>
        <div class="post-excerpt">Roogoo虚拟卡深度实测！主打0费率与多场景覆盖，真的是跨境支付自由神器吗？全方位揭秘Roogoo虚拟信用卡的优缺点，助您实现低成本海外消费。</div>
      </div>
    </article><article class="post-card">
      <a class="post-thumb" href="/paypal-cross-border-fees-withdrawal-guide-2026/"><img src="/media/17018740-paypal-fees-cover.png" alt="PayPal 跨境收款费率与提现全解析：4.4% 成本怎么算、四条提现路径对比（2026）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a>
      <div class="post-body">
        <div class="post-meta"><span class="cat">评测</span><span>2026-10-21</span></div>
        <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/paypal-cross-border-fees-withdrawal-guide-2026/">PayPal 跨境收款费率与提现全解析：4.4% 成本怎么算、四条提现路径对比（2026）</a></h2>
        <div class="post-excerpt">基于 PayPal 官方费率页核验（2026-10）：中国大陆收款 4.4%+0.30 美元，币种兑换加价 3.5%–4%，电汇/香港账户/美国账户/支票四条提现路径最低额与费用逐项对比，附万里汇中转降本方案与 180 天风控须知。</div>
      </div>
    </article><article class="post-card">
      <a class="post-thumb" href="/meta-ads-payment-billing-guide-2026/"><img src="/media/57450002-featured.png" alt="Meta 广告付款机制详解：Facebook/Instagram 广告扣款、阈值与拒付处理（2026）" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a>
      <div class="post-body">
        <div class="post-meta"><span class="cat">评测</span><span>2026-10-18</span></div>
        <h2 class="post-title"><a href="/meta-ads-payment-billing-guide-2026/">Meta 广告付款机制详解：Facebook/Instagram 广告扣款、阈值与拒付处理（2026）</a></h2>
        <div class="post-excerpt">Meta 广告怎么扣费？本文拆解 Facebook/Instagram 广告的付款阈值、自动扣款与预存余额两种模式、币种锁定规则、扣款失败排查路径，以及虚拟卡付广告费的合规边界。</div>
      </div>
    </article><article class="post-card">
      <a class="post-thumb" href="/pinterest-ads-payment-billing-guide-2026/"><img src="/media/39302704-featured-pinterest-ads-payment.png" alt="Pinterest Ads 付款全攻略：阈值扣费、支持的卡种与预付费规则（2026）" width="1600" height="900" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a>
